 of a \"village-based economy.\"\nIn the early 1940s, X wrote to Gandhi, expressing his deep respect for the Mahatma’s message of peace and non-violence. He reportedly told friends that Gandhi was \"the greatest man of the age.\"\nIn 1941, during the height of World War II, Gandhi decided to send a gift to X. He didn't send a book or a photo; he sent a portable spinning wheel (Charkha) that he had used himself. Gandhi autographed the wooden frame and sent it across the Atlantic—at a time when the ocean was infested with German U-boats.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T06:52:24Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "morgan?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T06:52:51Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "ford?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T06:52:56Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "no", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T06:53:04Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "oh shit", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T06:53:14Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Surprising tbf", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T06:53:18Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Ford is correct. Received a autographed charkha 😅", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]